{"t": 1794108440.5220852, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix.\n\n**Root cause:** Sentry CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q \u2014 `PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist` (2,940 events, os=Android 15, app=android 8.2). The Android keyboard adds surrounding spaces and lower-case input, and `checkout.promo.normalize_code` was a pass-through returning the code unchanged, so lookups failed.\n\n**Change:** `checkout/promo.py` \u2014 `normalize_code` now strips surrounding whitespace, removes inner spaces, and upper-cases the code before lookup.\n\n```python\ndef normalize_code(code: str) -> str:\n    return code.strip().replace(\" \", \"\").upper()\n```\n\n**Verification:** locally checked `' autumn24 '`, `'Autumn 24'`, `'\\tAutumn24\\n'` and `'  a u t u m n 2 4  '` all normalise to `'AUTUMN24'`.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
